cb28fc12e22a384676ca6a\" style=\"margin-top:0px\">Lack of Real-Time Project Visibility</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7d64f0c712d4428cc305d9ac54ad7e87 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#000000a8;margin-bottom:30px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.078), 15px);\">Most construction teams rely on delayed MIS reports, Excel sheets, or WhatsApp updates. By the time data reaches management, it's already outdated. SiteFlow's construction reporting and analytics software delivers real-time project dashboards that consolidate progress, costs, and productivity across sites, so decisions are based on live data, not assumptions.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-stretch has-border-color has-palette-color-8-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#0000001f;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;border-radius:20px;padding-top:30px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:30px;padding-left:30px\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-1eb0540d5f9b731892f2fa91c680935d\" style=\"margin-top:0px\">Inability to Track Cost &amp; Budget Deviations Early</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-74de5724b399e43cab27634e89b21f18 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#000000a8;margin-bottom:30px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.078), 15px);\">Cost overruns often surface only after bills are processed or month-end reviews are done. By then, recovery is difficult. With cost vs budget analytics, SiteFlow continuously compares planned and actual spends, helping teams identify leakages, deviations, and risk areas early instead of reacting late.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-stretch has-border-color has-palette-color-8-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\